<title>USA: New York grain freight fixtures - Sept 6.</title>
<headline>New York grain freight fixtures - Sept 6.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polska Walczaca 54,000 long tons hss USG/Japan $19.20 no combo $19.70 w/combo 11 days shex 15-20/9 Korea Line.</p>
<p>TBN 21,000-22,000 long tons grains USG/Rio Haina $9.50 5,000/1,500 14-25/9 Garnac.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodities Desk +1 212 859 1640</p>
